#: conf.json:summary
msgid "A work-in-progress proof assistant written in MoonBit, built around a type checker for Martin-Löf type theory."
msgstr "一个用 MoonBit 编写、仍在开发中的证明助手，核心是 Martin-Löf 类型论的类型检查器。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:1
msgid "elab API"
msgstr "elab API 参考"

#: manual/api/elab.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/api/elab.md:5
msgid "The `elab` package (`src/elab`, import path `Luna-Flow/stella/elab`) is the kernel of stella: the syntax of a dependent type theory, its evaluation into values, the read-back of values into normal forms, and a bidirectional type checker. Its interface file is [`src/elab/pkg.generated.mbti`](../../../src/elab/pkg.generated.mbti)."
msgstr "`elab` 包（`src/elab`，导入路径 `Luna-Flow/stella/elab`）是 stella 的内核：包含依值类型论的语法、将语法求值为值、将值读回为范式，以及一个双向类型检查器。其接口文件为 [`src/elab/pkg.generated.mbti`](../../../src/elab/pkg.generated.mbti)。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:7
msgid "Terms use de Bruijn indices: `Bound(0)` is the variable bound by the nearest enclosing binder. The binders are `Lam`, the second argument of `Pi`, `Sigma` and `W`, and nothing else. The [design notes](../design/elab.md) give the typing rules in full."
msgstr "项使用德布鲁因索引：`Bound(0)` 是由最近的外层绑定子绑定的变量。绑定子只有 `Lam`，以及 `Pi`、`Sigma` 和 `W` 的第二个参数。完整的类型规则见[设计说明](../design/elab.md)。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:9
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/elab.md:11
msgid "Add the package and the list package, which provides contexts and environments, to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中加入本包以及提供上下文和环境的 list 包："

#: manual/api/elab.md:20
msgid "The examples on this page bring the types into scope with one `using` declaration, so that constructors can be written without the `@elab.` prefix:"
msgstr "本页的示例用一个 `using` 声明把这些类型引入作用域，这样构造子可以不带 `@elab.` 前缀书写："

#: manual/api/elab.md:26
#: manual/design/elab.md:22
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "语法"

#: manual/api/elab.md:30
msgid "`Name` identifies a free variable."
msgstr "`Name` 标识一个自由变量。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:41
#: manual/api/elab.md:73
#: manual/api/elab.md:107
msgid "Constructor"
msgstr "构造子"

#: manual/api/elab.md:41
#: manual/api/elab.md:73
#: manual/api/elab.md:107
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: manual/api/elab.md:43
msgid "A constant declared by the user in the typing context, such as a postulated type `A`."
msgstr "由用户在类型上下文中声明的常量，例如一个公设的类型 `A`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:44
msgid "A variable that the type checker introduces when it goes under a binder; `level` counts the binders from the outside, starting at 0."
msgstr "类型检查器进入绑定子时引入的变量；`level` 从外向内计数绑定子，从 0 开始。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:45
msgid "A variable that `quote` introduces when it reads back a function body; `quote` turns it back into a `Bound` index."
msgstr "`quote` 读回函数体时引入的变量；`quote` 会将其还原为 `Bound` 索引。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:47
msgid "User code normally creates only `Global` names. `Name::equal` is the promoted `Eq` method; prefer `==`."
msgstr "用户代码通常只创建 `Global` 名字。`Name::equal` 是提升后的 `Eq` 方法；请优先使用 `==`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:51
msgid "`TermInf` is the type of terms whose type the checker can infer."
msgstr "`TermInf` 是检查器能够推断其类型的项的类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:73
#: manual/api/elab.md:107
msgid "Notation"
msgstr "记法"

#: manual/api/elab.md:75
msgid "The variable bound by the $i$-th enclosing binder, counting from 0."
msgstr "由第 $i$ 个外层绑定子绑定的变量，从 0 开始计数。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:76
msgid "A free variable, looked up in the typing context."
msgstr "自由变量，在类型上下文中查找。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:77
msgid "The unit type."
msgstr "单位类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:78
msgid "The universe at level $i \\ge 0$."
msgstr "层级为 $i \\ge 0$ 的宇宙。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:79
msgid "The checkable term `t` annotated with the type `T`."
msgstr "以类型 `T` 标注的可检查项 `t`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:80
msgid "Dependent function type; `B` is under one binder."
msgstr "依值函数类型；`B` 位于一个绑定子之下。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:81
msgid "Function application."
msgstr "函数应用。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:82
msgid "Dependent pair type; `B` is under one binder."
msgstr "依值对类型；`B` 位于一个绑定子之下。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:83
msgid "Projections of a pair."
msgstr "对的投影。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:84
msgid "Identity type."
msgstr "恒等类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:85
msgid "The based path eliminator: from `d : P x (refl x)` and `p : Id(A, x, y)`, a term of `P y p`. `P` is a function term of type $\\Pi_{y : A} \\mathrm{Id}_A(x, y) \\to \\mathcal U_k$."
msgstr "基于点的路径消去子：由 `d : P x (refl x)` 和 `p : Id(A, x, y)` 得到 `P y p` 的一个项。`P` 是类型为 $\\Pi_{y : A} \\mathrm{Id}_A(x, y) \\to \\mathcal U_k$ 的函数项。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:86
msgid "Well-founded tree type; `B` is under one binder."
msgstr "良基树类型；`B` 位于一个绑定子之下。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:87
msgid "Recursion on `w : W(A, B)` into the motive `P`. Unlike in `W`, `B` here is a function term of type $A \\to \\mathcal U_k$."
msgstr "对 `w : W(A, B)` 进行递归，目标为动机 `P`。与 `W` 中不同，这里的 `B` 是类型为 $A \\to \\mathcal U_k$ 的函数项。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:89
msgid "`TermInf::equal` compares terms structurally, which is $\\alpha$-equivalence because variables are de Bruijn indices; prefer `==`."
msgstr "`TermInf::equal` 按结构比较项，由于变量是德布鲁因索引，这正是 $\\alpha$-等价；请优先使用 `==`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:93
msgid "`TermChk` is the type of terms that the checker checks against a known type."
msgstr "`TermChk` 是检查器对照已知类型进行检查的项的类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:109
msgid "An inferable term used where a checkable one is expected."
msgstr "在需要可检查项的位置使用的可推断项。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:110
msgid "The element of the unit type."
msgstr "单位类型的元素。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:111
msgid "Function abstraction; `t` is under one binder. The domain is not written, it comes from the expected type."
msgstr "函数抽象；`t` 位于一个绑定子之下。定义域不需写出，它来自期望类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:112
msgid "Dependent pair."
msgstr "依值对。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:113
msgid "Reflexivity proof of $\\mathrm{Id}_A(t, t)$."
msgstr "$\\mathrm{Id}_A(t, t)$ 的自反性证明。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:114
msgid "Node of a W type with label `a` and child function `f`."
msgstr "W 类型的节点，标签为 `a`，子节点函数为 `f`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:116
msgid "A type is written as a `TermChk`, but most typing rules infer the type of a type, so a type position must contain `Inf(...)`, for example `Inf(UnitType)`."
msgstr "类型写作 `TermChk`，但大多数类型规则会推断类型的类型，因此类型位置必须包含 `Inf(...)`，例如 `Inf(UnitType)`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:130
msgid "Values"
msgstr "值"

#: manual/api/elab.md:134
msgid "`Value` is the semantic domain: terms evaluated to weak head normal form, with binders represented as MoonBit functions."
msgstr "`Value` 是语义域：求值到弱头范式的项，其中绑定子表示为 MoonBit 函数。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:154
msgid "Each constructor corresponds to a term constructor. A binder body becomes a function `(Value) -> Value`: `VPi(a, b)` is $\\Pi_{x : a} b(x)$, and `VLam(f)` is the function $x \\mapsto f(x)$. Values are also used as types, and `Type` is an alias of `Value` that the package uses for that role. Because values contain functions, `Value` has no `Eq`; compare values with `def_eq` or by comparing their normal forms from `quote`. `Debug` prints a function as `<function: ...>`."
msgstr "每个构造子对应一个项构造子。绑定子的体变成函数 `(Value) -> Value`：`VPi(a, b)` 即 $\\Pi_{x : a} b(x)$，`VLam(f)` 即函数 $x \\mapsto f(x)$。值也被用作类型，`Type` 是 `Value` 的别名，包在这一角色中使用它。由于值包含函数，`Value` 没有 `Eq`；请用 `def_eq` 比较值，或比较它们经 `quote` 得到的范式。`Debug` 将函数打印为 `<function: ...>`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:158
msgid "`Neutral` is a computation that is stuck on a free variable."
msgstr "`Neutral` 是卡在自由变量上的计算。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:171
msgid "A neutral term is a free variable followed by a spine of eliminations that cannot reduce: an application of a variable, a projection of a variable, or `J` or `wrec` on a variable. A neutral term is a value through `VNeutral`."
msgstr "中性项是一个自由变量后跟一串无法归约的消去：变量的应用、变量的投影，或作用于变量的 `J` 或 `wrec`。中性项通过 `VNeutral` 成为值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:175
msgid "`Context` assigns types to free variables; `Env` assigns values to bound variables."
msgstr "`Context` 为自由变量指定类型；`Env` 为约束变量指定值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:182
msgid "A `Context` is searched from the head, so a later declaration shadows an earlier one. In an `Env`, the head is the value of `Bound(0)`, the next element the value of `Bound(1)`, and so on."
msgstr "`Context` 从头部开始查找，因此后面的声明会遮蔽前面的声明。在 `Env` 中，头部是 `Bound(0)` 的值，下一个元素是 `Bound(1)` 的值，依此类推。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:184
#: manual/design/elab.md:51
msgid "Evaluation"
msgstr "求值"

#: manual/api/elab.md:188
msgid "`eval_inf` and `eval_chk` evaluate a term in an environment."
msgstr "`eval_inf` 和 `eval_chk` 在环境中对项求值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:195
msgid "They compute the weak head normal form, $\\llbracket t \\rrbracket_\\rho$ in the design notes: annotations are erased, binders become closures over the environment, and eliminations reduce through the `val_` functions below. Evaluation does not type-check. On an ill-typed term it can panic, for example when a non-function is applied or `Bound(i)` has no entry in the environment."
msgstr "它们计算弱头范式，即设计说明中的 $\\llbracket t \\rrbracket_\\rho$：标注被擦除，绑定子变成捕获环境的闭包，消去通过下面的 `val_` 函数归约。求值不做类型检查。对于类型错误的项，它可能 panic，例如对非函数进行应用，或 `Bound(i)` 在环境中没有对应条目时。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:207
msgid "`val_var` is the value of a free variable."
msgstr "`val_var` 是自由变量的值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:213
msgid "`val_var(x)` is `VNeutral(NFree(x))`."
msgstr "`val_var(x)` 即 `VNeutral(NFree(x))`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:217
msgid "These apply a function value and project a pair value."
msgstr "这些函数应用函数值并投影对值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:225
msgid "They implement the $\\beta$-rules $(\\lambda f)\\,v = f(v)$, $\\pi_1 (v, w) = v$ and $\\pi_2 (v, w) = w$. On a neutral argument they extend the neutral spine. On any other value they panic."
msgstr "它们实现 $\\beta$ 规则 $(\\lambda f)\\,v = f(v)$、$\\pi_1 (v, w) = v$ 和 $\\pi_2 (v, w) = w$。对中性参数，它们扩展中性序列；对其他任何值则 panic。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:229
msgid "`val_j_elim` evaluates the path eliminator."
msgstr "`val_j_elim` 对路径消去子求值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:235
msgid "`val_j_elim(a, x, p, d, y, e)` returns `d` when `e` is `VRfl(_)`, the rule $J(A, x, P, d, x, \\mathrm{refl}\\,x) = d$, extends the neutral spine when `e` is neutral, and panics otherwise."
msgstr "`val_j_elim(a, x, p, d, y, e)` 在 `e` 为 `VRfl(_)` 时返回 `d`（即规则 $J(A, x, P, d, x, \\mathrm{refl}\\,x) = d$），在 `e` 为中性时扩展中性序列，其他情况下 panic。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:239
msgid "`val_w_rec` evaluates W recursion."
msgstr "`val_w_rec` 对 W 递归求值。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:245
msgid "`val_w_rec(a, b, p, s, w)` computes, for `w = VSup(l, f)`,"
msgstr "对于 `w = VSup(l, f)`，`val_w_rec(a, b, p, s, w)` 计算"

#: manual/api/elab.md:251
msgid "that is, the step function applied to the label, the children and the recursive results on the children. It extends the neutral spine when `w` is neutral and panics otherwise."
msgstr "即将步进函数应用于标签、子节点以及对子节点的递归结果。当 `w` 为中性时扩展中性序列，其他情况下 panic。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:255
msgid "`val_max_univ` returns the larger of two universes."
msgstr "`val_max_univ` 返回两个宇宙中较大的一个。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:261
msgid "`val_max_univ(VUniverse(i), VUniverse(j))` is `VUniverse(max(i, j))`. Any other argument panics. The checker computes the level of a $\\Pi$, $\\Sigma$ or $W$ type with this rule but does not call the function."
msgstr "`val_max_univ(VUniverse(i), VUniverse(j))` 即 `VUniverse(max(i, j))`。任何其他参数都会 panic。检查器用这条规则计算 $\\Pi$、$\\Sigma$ 或 $W$ 类型的层级，但并不调用该函数。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:263
msgid "The semantic eliminations reduce on introduction forms and get stuck on variables:"
msgstr "语义消去在引入形式上归约，在变量上卡住："

#: manual/api/elab.md:283
msgid "Normal forms"
msgstr "范式"

#: manual/api/elab.md:287
msgid "`quote` reads a value back into a term in normal form; `neutral_quote` does the same for a neutral term."
msgstr "`quote` 将值读回为范式项；`neutral_quote` 对中性项做同样的事。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:294
msgid "`quote(l, v)` expects `l` to be the number of binders the value is under, normally `0`. To read back a closure it applies the closure to a fresh variable `Quote(l)` and quotes the body at `l + 1`. `neutral_quote` turns a variable `Quote(k)` into the index `Bound(l - k - 1)` and leaves other names as `Free(x)`. The normal form of a term $t$ is `quote(0, eval_chk(t, @list.empty()))`; two terms with equal normal forms are $\\beta$-equal."
msgstr "`quote(l, v)` 要求 `l` 为值所处的绑定子个数，通常为 `0`。为读回闭包，它将闭包应用于新变量 `Quote(l)`，并在 `l + 1` 处读回函数体。`neutral_quote` 将变量 `Quote(k)` 转为索引 `Bound(l - k - 1)`，其他名字保留为 `Free(x)`。项 $t$ 的范式是 `quote(0, eval_chk(t, @list.empty()))`；范式相等的两个项是 $\\beta$-相等的。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:305
msgid "Type checking"
msgstr "类型检查"

#: manual/api/elab.md:309
msgid "`TypeError` is the error raised by the type checker."
msgstr "`TypeError` 是类型检查器抛出的错误。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:317
msgid "The message names the rule that failed, for example `Illegal Application`, `Expected Pi type for Lambda`, `Type Mismatch: inferred type is not a subtype of expected type`, `Rfl endpoints mismatch` or `Unknown Identifier: Global(\"b\")`."
msgstr "消息会指出失败的规则，例如 `Illegal Application`、`Expected Pi type for Lambda`、`Type Mismatch: inferred type is not a subtype of expected type`、`Rfl endpoints mismatch` 或 `Unknown Identifier: Global(\"b\")`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:321
msgid "`type_inf` infers the type of a term; `type_chk` checks a term against a type."
msgstr "`type_inf` 推断项的类型；`type_chk` 对照类型检查项。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:328
msgid "`type_inf(l, ctx, env, e)` returns the type of `e` as a value, and `type_chk(l, ctx, env, t, ty)` returns normally when `t` has type `ty`; both raise `TypeError` otherwise. The arguments describe the position of the term:"
msgstr "`type_inf(l, ctx, env, e)` 以值的形式返回 `e` 的类型；当 `t` 的类型为 `ty` 时，`type_chk(l, ctx, env, t, ty)` 正常返回；否则两者都抛出 `TypeError`。这些参数描述项所处的位置："

#: manual/api/elab.md:330
msgid "`l` is the number of binders the checker has entered, and `Local(l)` is the next fresh variable;"
msgstr "`l` 是检查器已进入的绑定子个数，`Local(l)` 是下一个新变量；"

#: manual/api/elab.md:331
msgid "`ctx` contains the user's `Global` declarations and one entry `(Local(k), A_k)` for every binder entered;"
msgstr "`ctx` 包含用户的 `Global` 声明，并为每个已进入的绑定子包含一个条目 `(Local(k), A_k)`；"

#: manual/api/elab.md:332
msgid "`env` has one entry `val_var(Local(k))` for every binder entered, the innermost first."
msgstr "`env` 为每个已进入的绑定子包含一个条目 `val_var(Local(k))`，最内层的在前。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:334
msgid "At the top level, pass `0`, the user's context and an empty environment. `Bound(i)` is resolved through `env` and then `ctx`, so `env` may contain only variables that are declared in `ctx`; any other value raises `TypeError(\"Internal error: Bound variable not in environment\")`, and a variable of `env` missing from `ctx` raises `TypeError(\"Unknown Identifier\")`. In checking mode, a term that can only be inferred is accepted when its inferred type is a subtype of the expected one (cumulativity, see `def_eq`)."
msgstr "在顶层，传入 `0`、用户的上下文和空环境。`Bound(i)` 先通过 `env` 再通过 `ctx` 解析，因此 `env` 只能包含在 `ctx` 中声明过的变量；其他任何值会引发 `TypeError(\"Internal error: Bound variable not in environment\")`，而 `env` 中未在 `ctx` 声明的变量会引发 `TypeError(\"Unknown Identifier\")`。在检查模式下，只能推断的项在其推断类型是期望类型的子类型时被接受（累积性，参见 `def_eq`）。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:336
msgid "[!WARNING] An index with no entry in `env` aborts instead of raising `TypeError`: `type_inf_0(ctx, Bound(0))` panics, because the lookup unwraps a missing list element. Check that a term is closed (every `Bound(i)` lies under more than `i` binders) before passing it at the top level."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 在 `env` 中没有对应条目的索引会直接中止，而不是引发 `TypeError`：`type_inf_0(ctx, Bound(0))` 会 panic，因为查找时对缺失的列表元素做了 unwrap。在顶层传入项之前，请确认它是闭项（每个 `Bound(i)` 都位于多于 `i` 个绑定子之下）。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:339
msgid "`type_chk` trusts its expected type: pass a value that is already known to be a type, such as the result of `type_inf` or the evaluation of a checked type. On an ill-formed expected type the checker may panic in the semantic eliminations."
msgstr "`type_chk` 信任它的期望类型：请传入已知是类型的值，例如 `type_inf` 的结果或已检查类型的求值结果。期望类型不合法时，检查器可能在语义消去中 panic。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:353
msgid "`type_inf_0` infers the type of a closed term in a context of global declarations."
msgstr "`type_inf_0` 在由全局声明组成的上下文中推断闭项的类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:359
msgid "`type_inf_0(ctx, e)` is `type_inf(0, ctx, @list.empty(), e)`. Declare a constant by adding `(Global(name), type)` to `ctx`; the type is a value, for example `VUniverse(0)` for a type variable or `VNeutral(NFree(Global(\"A\")))` for an element of a declared type `A`."
msgstr "`type_inf_0(ctx, e)` 即 `type_inf(0, ctx, @list.empty(), e)`。通过向 `ctx` 添加 `(Global(name), type)` 来声明常量；类型是一个值，例如类型变量用 `VUniverse(0)`，已声明类型 `A` 的元素用 `VNeutral(NFree(Global(\"A\")))`。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:380
msgid "`def_eq` decides whether one type is a subtype of another in the empty context."
msgstr "`def_eq` 判定在空上下文中一个类型是否为另一个类型的子类型。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:386
msgid "`def_eq(l, s, t)` returns `true` when $s \\le t$ under the cumulative subtyping of the design notes, with `l` the number of binders the values are under (normally `0`): $\\mathcal U_i \\le \\mathcal U_j$ for $i \\le j$, $\\Pi$ types are contravariant in the domain and covariant in the codomain, $\\Sigma$ types are invariant in the first component and covariant in the second, and all other types are compared by conversion. Despite its name the relation is not symmetric: `def_eq(0, VUniverse(0), VUniverse(1))` is `true` and `def_eq(0, VUniverse(1), VUniverse(0))` is `false`. On two values that are not types, such as two functions, it compares their read-backs, which is $\\beta$-equality."
msgstr "当 $s \\le t$ 在设计说明中的累积子类型关系下成立时，`def_eq(l, s, t)` 返回 `true`，其中 `l` 是这些值所处的绑定子个数（通常为 `0`）：对 $i \\le j$ 有 $\\mathcal U_i \\le \\mathcal U_j$，$\\Pi$ 类型在定义域上逆变、在陪域上协变，$\\Sigma$ 类型在第一分量上不变、在第二分量上协变，其他所有类型按转换（conversion）比较。尽管名字如此，该关系并不对称：`def_eq(0, VUniverse(0), VUniverse(1))` 为 `true`，而 `def_eq(0, VUniverse(1), VUniverse(0))` 为 `false`。对两个不是类型的值（例如两个函数），它比较二者的读回结果，即 $\\beta$-相等。"

#: manual/api/elab.md:388
msgid "[!NOTE] Because the context is empty, `def_eq` cannot look up the type of a free variable. Two neutral terms are then compared by their read-backs, so `f x` equals `f x` for a free `f`, but arguments that are only $\\eta$-equal, such as `f g` and `f (λx. g x)`, are not identified. Inside `type_chk`, where the context is known, $\\eta$ is used."
msgstr "[!NOTE] 由于上下文为空，`def_eq` 无法查找自由变量的类型。此时两个中性项按其读回结果比较，因此对自由变量 `f` 而言 `f x` 等于 `f x`；但仅在 $\\eta$ 意义下相等的参数（例如 `f g` 与 `f (λx. g x)`）不会被识别为相等。在上下文已知的 `type_chk` 内部会使用 $\\eta$。"

